  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Kvinna till Kvinna st&#xf6;d till kvinnororganisationer</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kvinna till Kvinna support women&apos;s empowerment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Svenska NGO Kvinna till Kvinna med sitt program &quot;Women&apos;s empowerment  programme in Liberia&quot; under &#xe5;ren 2011-2015 st&#xf6;djer liberianska        kvinnororganisationer med organisationsutveckling och                 konfliktf&#xf6;rebyggande projekt. Det samlade st&#xf6;det f&#xf6;r fem&#xe5;rsperioden   uppg&#xe5;r till 49 miljoner svenska kronor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Swedish NGO Kvinna till Kvinna with its programme &quot;Women&apos;s        empowerment programme in Liberia&quot; during 2011-2015 will support       Liberian women&apos;s organisations in organisational development projects as well as conflict prevention projects. The total support for the    five years is 49 million Swedish Kronor.</narrative>
  </description>
